Thanks!

There was a bug in featureCounts when the input BAM file was from STAR or Picard. This bug had been fixed in the 1.29.2 version of our Rsubread package (it was also fixed in Subread-1.6.1 on sourceforge.net <http://sourceforge.net>). However, the released version of Rsubread (v1.28.1) doesn't have the bug fixed.

The next release of Rsubread should be soon. Before that, you may use samtools to sort the BAM files first (no matter in the read-name order or coordinate order) then run featureCounts on them.

